---
import { practice } from '../../data/content';
---
<section id="about" class="section bg-ivory text-ink">
  <div class="wrap grid items-center gap-16 lg:grid-cols-12">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal="left">
      <div class="group relative mx-auto aspect-[4/5] w-full max-w-md">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-t-[999px] rounded-b-3xl border border-gold transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-4 group-hover:translate-y-4"></div>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden rounded-t-[999px] rounded-b-3xl bg-midnight">
          <img
            src="/images/Dr-Robert-M-Narvaez.webp"
            alt="Dr. Robert M. Narvaez smiling, wearing a dark suit"
            width="408" height="510" loading="lazy"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover object-top transition-transform duration-[1200ms] ease-out group-hover:scale-105"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-7" data-reveal="right">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-light md:text-6xl">Meet Dr. Robert M. Narvaez</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 max-w-xl space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
        <p>
          Dr. Narvaez is a gastroenterologist in San Antonio. He is known as one of the city’s top colon cancer specialists.
        </p>
        <p>
          At the {practice.name} he cares for the stomach, colon, liver and gallbladder, from everyday heartburn to cirrhosis.
          His patients say he listens, takes his time and explains things in plain words.
        </p>
      </div>

      <ul class="mt-10 grid max-w-xl gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-ink/10 bg-ink/10 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <li class="bg-ivory p-5 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-sand"><p class="font-heading text-2xl text-ink">MD, MBA</p><p class="text-sm text-ink/65">Medicine and business</p></li>
        <li class="bg-ivory p-5 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-sand"><p class="font-heading text-2xl text-ink">Gastro</p><p class="text-sm text-ink/65">Digestive and liver care</p></li>
        <li class="bg-ivory p-5 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-sand"><p class="font-heading text-2xl text-ink">Colon</p><p class="text-sm text-ink/65">Cancer specialist</p></li>
      </ul>

      <a href={practice.phoneHref} class="btn btn-ink mt-10">Call the office</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
